### 查询检测流程
GET http://localhost:8081/api/detection/flows

### 查询车辆月度流程节点
GET http://localhost:8081/api/detection/flows/VEHICLE_MONTHLY_COMPLIANCE_FLOW/nodes

### 查询检测器注册表
GET http://localhost:8081/api/detection/detectors

### 执行车辆月度运行合规异常检测流程
POST http://localhost:8081/api/anomaly/tasks/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flowCode": "VEHICLE_MONTHLY_COMPLIANCE_FLOW",
  "countyName": "福清市",
  "period": "2026-04",
  "objectType": "VEHICLE",
  "operator": "student"
}

### 查询车辆异常结果
GET http://localhost:8081/api/anomaly/list?objectType=VEHICLE

### 查询轨迹证据展示数据
GET http://localhost:8081/api/anomaly/evidence/track/vehicles/VEHICLE-001?period=2026-04
